{"39680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Guild II Renaissance", "steam_appid": 39680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "For centuries Europe has been dominated by the church and nobility. On the shoulders of ordinary people the servants of god and the noble families justified their power and wealth. This was the incontrovertible, divine world order. A truly dark era…<br>\t\t\t\t\tIn the 14th Century the world order is beginning to transform itself. Due to trade and commerce an increasing middle class obtains more and more power and wealth. Entire towns purchase their freedom and more privileges from the nobility. Reading and writing is no longer the domain of the nobility and the clergy and the invention of printing information may eventually be spread everywhere. This is the beginning of the renaissance...<br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 completely new professions: mercenary, grave digger, stonemason, juggler, innkeeper, banker, miller and the fruit grower<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>New goods, buildings, ambient details and effects<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>All new scenarios (&quot;Transylvania&quot;, &quot;The Rhineland&quot; and &quot;The Alps&quot;) &amp; bigger world maps <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Improved AI, title and nobility system as well as new options (e.g. “God Measures”, levels of difficulty)</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "For centuries Europe has been dominated by the church and nobility. On the shoulders of ordinary people the servants of god and the noble families justified their power and wealth. This was the incontrovertible, divine world order. A truly dark era…<br>\t\t\t\t\tIn the 14th Century the world order is beginning to transform itself. Due to trade and commerce an increasing middle class obtains more and more power and wealth. Entire towns purchase their freedom and more privileges from the nobility. Reading and writing is no longer the domain of the nobility and the clergy and the invention of printing information may eventually be spread everywhere. This is the beginning of the renaissance...<br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 completely new professions: mercenary, grave digger, stonemason, juggler, innkeeper, banker, miller and the fruit grower<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>New goods, buildings, ambient details and effects<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>All new scenarios (&quot;Transylvania&quot;, &quot;The Rhineland&quot; and &quot;The Alps&quot;) &amp; bigger world maps <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Improved AI, title and nobility system as well as new options (e.g. “God Measures”, levels of difficulty)</li></ul>", "short_description": "For centuries Europe has been dominated by the church and nobility. On the shoulders of ordinary people the servants of god and the noble families justified their power and wealth. This was the incontrovertible, divine world order. A truly dark era… In the 14th Century the world order is beginning to transform itself.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39680/header.jpg?t=1764839890", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764839890", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764839890", "website": "https://theguild.thqnordic.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® XP, Vista, 7, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9 capable graphics adapter with Pixelshader Model 1.1<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Soun